{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-1\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“一想到这个人就柔软起来，很想亲近”保留了R1的核心心理；“被这份心意撞得有些措手不及”是主观、戏剧化的强化，没有把烟花写成真实事件，也没有明确把音乐变化当作心理原因。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-2\",\n      \"label\": \"越界\",\n      \"why\": \"“他知道话一出口，关系就可能变样，真想靠近时还是把话咽回去”把B2中准备向亲近的人说话、担心关系变化的比喻处境落实成了他实际面临的说话情境和具体动作。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S01-3\",\n      \"label\": \"ok\",\n      \"why\": \"“还没想好要不要把喜欢往前推”与“说不准自己为什么……收得这么紧”写的是未决和自我克制，没有新增具体人物关系、外部事件、对白或场景，也没有音乐术语。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"links\": [],\n  \"readable\": \"是\",\n  \"readable_why\": \"只读线就能读出从想亲近，到顾虑关系变化而收住，再到尚未决定是否推进的心理链条，前后关系清楚。\",\n  \"lost\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R2\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"“想让这份喜欢多停留一会儿”的愿望没有保留；修补后写了想亲近和收住，却没有表达他希望这份喜欢本身多停留一会儿。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R3\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"“眼下还没有非作决定不可的事”这一没有迫切决断压力的前提没有保留；“还没想好要不要把喜欢往前推”只说明尚未决定，不等于眼下没有必须决定的事。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R4\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"“这点喜欢轻得仿佛随时可以放下”的轻微、不稳定感没有保留；“把喜欢收得这么紧”保留了舍不得放下的倾向，却没有保留喜欢本身似乎很容易放下的反差。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [],\n  \"wordy\": [\n    {\n      \"ids\": [\n        \"S01-2\",\n        \"S01-3\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"两条都写靠近时的克制：前条说把话咽回去，后条又说把喜欢收得很紧，后半句存在重复；S01-3前半句关于尚未决定是否推进，仍有独立信息。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "8f0bfa79-125a-4ffc-9187-0bafb657ec0d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T100308300600Z", "elapsed_seconds": 286.063, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T10:07:54.359021+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "40ab87d46273f62c6b4f416bf38cf1bd8ddb22b0c7608b8a3deb4d87f3c3f371", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T100308300600Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "a237bbfbbfa2d94bb4c102ebbed6bcb3dba3a3ac6cceca73209efdd479c344ae"}}}
